7723076001-85f2557a-c606-4c6a-a3ae-af16ea40fa66"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0683105d1fb3922198cba6ac299cd3f675912ced3dc66c0a1fd20dd59b2b0ee6","event_uuid":"1046c71b-1721-47f4-b539-94d4ffddfaf0","position":{"commit_sha":"c3be0fcac01a632a06524d1a33d68acfe4d2d556","position":"1789040152137961001-1046c71b-1721-47f4-b539-94d4ffddfaf0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"4cfaa7b55b9523a459c4f7cabe376569ce2074771c60ca2a810f97ee7202dae5","event_uuid":"a4333559-f800-4f35-bfe5-2111752528bc","position":{"commit_sha":"72bb45368b35a6b2324b64a142b24f1bad6c6261","position":"1789040172236058001-a4333559-f800-4f35-bfe5-2111752528bc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"preexisting","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RCA before fix: the two confirmed unbounded shapes remain present at origin/main. autodeploy.sh bounds fetch with FETCH_TIMEOUT but the first-run mirror bootstrap still calls git clone directly under the deploy lock; rebar-autodeploy.service TimeoutStartSec=90 prevents infinite timer latch but every missing-mirror tick can still consume the whole service budget. install-certbot-timer.sh renders certbot-renew.service as Type=oneshot with no TimeoutStartSec; if certbot renew hangs, systemd leaves the renewal unit activating and later timer firings do not start a new renewal. I am reusing the existing timeout idioms rather than adding new mechanisms.","timestamp":1789028067894618001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Completion evidence: Gerrit 2963 merged as 8ded030769729557c9ba9ca441b26f306b257d94 after LLM-Review+1 and Verified+1. RED tests were tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_certbot.py::test_autodeploy_bootstrap_clone_is_bounded and ::test_certbot_renew_service_renders_finite_start_timeout; both failed before the fix and pass now. Local make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=2 passed.","timestamp":1789037145797076001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Close remains blocked by host gate congestion, not by product or review failure: retry after merged Gerrit 2963 again returned GATE_CONGESTED for verify_completion (all 2 slots in use). Evidence and AC checkboxes are recorded; no --force used. I am moving on to the next assigned ticket while preserving this for later close retry.","timestamp":1789038287723076001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788571774189384721,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"01735b24-4d9d-4464-91e5-c5cd7aeca816","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"1205-63b2-2c01-4e7f"},{"link_uuid":"7a068937-0641-434a-b16d-f6fdd4d02213","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"f1fc-03a3-3e17-49b8"},{"link_uuid":"5b2291bc-1c68-4c1e-9358-68fe59dc32e8","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d92d-9ea2-c264-4756"}],"description":"## Where this came from\n\nStep-7 sibling sweep of `smudgeless-friendless-longspur` (`1205-63b2-2c01-4e7f`), whose confirmed\nroot cause is an unbounded external command inside a periodic probe on a `Type=oneshot` unit with\nno start timeout. That combination took Gerrit off the air for 41 minutes. The sweep looked for the\nsame shape elsewhere; these two hits were confirmed semantically (read in context) and are filed\nrather than fixed, because they are outside the blast radius that change reviewed.\n\n## Hit 1 — `infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh:787`: unbounded `git clone`\n\n```\nif ! git clone -q \"$MIRROR_URL\" \"$MIRROR_DIR\" 2>/dev/null; then\n```\n\nNo bound of any kind, inside the unit driven every 2 minutes by `rebar-autodeploy.timer`. Its\nSIBLING one line down is already correct — `autodeploy.sh:798` wraps `git fetch` in\n`timeout \"$FETCH_TIMEOUT\"` — so the omission is inconsistent within the same function, which is\nthe same signature the 1205 scans had against the `DOCKER_DU_TIMEOUT` calls in their own file.\n\nPartially mitigated by 1205's fix: `rebar-autodeploy.service` now carries `TimeoutStartSec=90`, so a\nhung clone can no longer delete the timer's next elapse. The clone itself is still unbounded, so it\ncan still consume its whole 90 seconds against a stalling remote on every tick.\n\nThis path runs only when `$MIRROR_DIR` is absent (a fresh box or a wiped mirror), which is why it is\nlower priority than the probe scans were.\n\n## Hit 2 — `infra/scripts/install-certbot-timer.sh:69`: `Type=oneshot`, no `TimeoutStartSec`\n\nRendered with `OnCalendar=*-*-* 00,12:00:00`. Less dangerous than the observability unit because\n`OnCalendar` is absolute wall-clock rather than computed from the last completed activation, so a\nhung run does not delete the next elapse the way `OnUnitActiveSec` does. It still leaves a unit\n`activating` forever with nothing to kill it, and systemd will not start a second activation while\nthe first is running, so certificate renewal silently stops.\n\n## Explicitly NOT filed, with the reason\n\n`bootstrap-gerrit-admin.sh`, `compose-up.sh` and `mcp-entrypoint.sh` also make unbounded `curl` /\n`git clone` calls. They are one-shot bootstrap and container-entry paths, not periodic units, so a\nhang there is visible as a failed boot rather than as a silently missing metric. Different failure\nmode, out of this category. Recorded so the sweep's coverage is legible rather than looking like an\nomission.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] AC1 - `autodeploy.sh`'s mirror `git clone` carries a finite wall-clock bound, using the same\n      idiom as the `git fetch` beside it.\n- [x] AC2 - A hanging clone is shown to terminate: the script is driven with a stubbed `git` that\n      blocks, and the run still completes.\n- [x] AC3 - The rendered certbot service declares a finite `TimeoutStartSec`, asserted against the\n      rendered unit rather than the script text.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/scripts/autodeploy.sh","reason":"Bound the bootstrap mirror git clone using the existing FETCH_TIMEOUT budget."},{"path":"infra/scripts/install-certbot-timer.sh","reason":"Render certbot-renew.service with a finite TimeoutStartSec for the periodic oneshot."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_materialize_certbot.py","reason":"Exercise the autodeploy mirror clone timeout and certbot unit rendering contracts."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","d92d-9ea2-c264-4756"],["relates_to","f1fc-03a3-3e17-49b8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"1046c71b-1721-47f4-b539-94d4ffddfaf0","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"a008-88cf-056e-44fb","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Two more systemd oneshots can hang unbounded: autodeploy's mirror `git clone` and the certbot unit's missing TimeoutStartSec","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["7c35db84-7037-4f2c-a486-6ac1e6ece58f","d8e0f2ae-40e3-4237-b02f-03e069830475","35413e7a-08af-44d5-9df2-55c1065ec760","848986e4-a1c4-4376-9385-e99c1d11305d","0b6bb54a-fdfa-4666-9fb5-bd5f0b12e7f1","7a068937-0641-434a-b16d-f6fdd4d02213","2e69dee0-91da-4424-8c90-63dee9099fdb","78dbe820-4548-433a-9c36-f71639f83938","5b2291bc-1c68-4c1e-9358-68fe59dc32e8","85f2557a-c606-4c6a-a3ae-af16ea40fa66","1046c71b-1721-47f4-b539-94d4ffddfaf0","a4333559-f800-4f35-bfe5-2111752528bc"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789042773753566251,"uuid":"dd2a3edb-c571-450e-a345-ae89b55d7bb6"}